                    "_type": "Diesel Product Footer",
                    "copy": "© 2021 Vanimals. Developed by Vanimals and Published by Skystone Games. All rights reserved. All other trademarks, logos and copyrights are property of their respective owners.",
                    "privacyPolicyLink": {
